    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:f0622f88b4a53c0ef553ffd3b418c53587aa5ae38b9906fe1fb7c7ed0487e9c9",
      "text": "2025 年，常州、泰兴及金山原料药基地均以零缺陷\n成功通过FDA 现场检查。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 9,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:4f58aa8ce6dd99e4ae6b2f60296bc571be2c915597b4d70c045921b9230453b5",
      "text": "截至2025 年末，小分子原料药反应釜总体积已提升至超\n4,000kL。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 10,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:3611369166708c2e846b6839d17908a778ba5424f28540e0b194752adf557f79",
      "text": "-\nTIDES 业务（寡核苷酸和多肽）保持高速增长。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 11,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:4d7b45685c47478c11d05455eb8f4742a20fa5e61fb4ef4f03383c56eef82970",
      "text": "i.\n随着2024 年新增产能逐季度爬坡，2025 年TIDES 业务收入达到113.7 亿元，同比\n增长96.0%。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 12,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:efe6e01aa622f86b5b07fd987175646552247faaa58f8071a4d69bb07bbd5194",
      "text": "截至2025 年末，TIDES 在手订单同比增长20.2%。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 13,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:fab527b2a106856de24cca3529dd4ccd6b35f79308e8346be56239b79647b580",
      "text": "ii.\nTIDES D&M 服务客户数同比提升25%，服务分子数量同比提升45%。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 14,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:f9cbc4f987add5457215500b5f720deca1967ab33079ba2673d0c79ad127f269",
      "text": "iii.\n2025 年9 月，提前完成泰兴多肽产能建设。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 15,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:9a9ba8e1b4a66b18cabc9340e4ba3a67f8fb100143bf37d6a122d62c9bfed119",
      "text": "公司多肽固相合成反应釜总体积已提升\n至超100,000L。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 16,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:d454da0634b309fda786477e4c268bc36a4671290e29655317499a419416f1ea",
      "text": "(2) 测试业务实现收入人民币40.4 亿元，同比恢复正增长4.7%。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 17,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:f90922c7ebcca06dc173180664ad9a44f6f0a0bf4b411ac59d25917e4584c747",
      "text": "报告期内：",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 18,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:4b61a8df99a23c75f3a7358c60c206c0595ed49e9e1f7ce4f71b87a7f9b19877",
      "text": "-\n药物安全性评价业务收入同比增长4.6%，持续保持亚太行业领先地位。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 19,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:31ae7f36bb787d9bd7f4b7c696de669f8ff488ddbd6da6b997acd7c8dcc5e49c",
      "text": "-\n公司积极助力客户开展全球授权许可合作。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 20,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:56f7fc0136ea7469e97ee4fdeeb0df9a021c4370b915474cb5ebd62f74310d65",
      "text": "新分子业务持续发力，2025 年收入占比进一\n步提升至超30%，在核酸类、偶联类、多特异性抗体类、多肽类等领域保持领先地位。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 21,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:2bf824ce9458f4be9acecdd8776493def74f5714be724da2e7a19d09aa7e7de0",
      "text": "-\n公司持续推进自动化，药性评价业务自主开发一站式化合物鉴定软件，助力客户核酸类\n和多肽类代谢产物鉴定，解谱效率提升83%。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 22,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:bb0405af01818cd799d7cf0ed3705a4eb7da2488e41b6f1b8203bde5ba4bcf19",
      "text": "-\n苏州、上海设施连续多次顺利通过FDA、OECD、NMPA、PMDA 检查。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 23,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:0e9c7d9fb435e11cf34d85b67241a720ae65bd14730f3bc04f72bd0afef41a80",
      "text": "(3) 生物学业务实现收入人民币26.8 亿元，同比恢复正增长5.2%。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 24,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:813f0d10aa1e3d9462a04e5e7b0d19f0aa54b497e05b6b6ba8afd55d24579056",
      "text": "报告期内：",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 25,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:5301f72f83990c4394c8881e5264cc5c8e4fbf75db8cdb5d2c81f2709a75faec",
      "text": "-\n生物学业务秉持科学驱动理念，前瞻布局药物发现热点及差异化能力；",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 26,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:8785094a3f14a900d29b87f2b5075953954b4058f6ef6df253fbba48c4536ee5",
      "text": "积极拓展全球业\n务，为公司CRDMO 业务模式高效引流，持续为公司带来超过20%的新客户。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 27,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:aa0f2accbda45cf4119bb6a62c27c246d27b2dabdefca70976b0add609e13892",
      "text": "-\n通过药物发现体内、外业务联动、跨区域合作和热点领域的一体化服务，高效赋能全球\n客户。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 28,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:dae2c2395c339889f13c2f1420ef40e80209ccf92d5110e61cf12584752019da",
      "text": "-\n体外综合筛选平台技术加速突破，体内药理学能力持续提升，驱动收入快速增长。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 29,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:6294d3763012951922b767b622dd60729b7b21dace7b5935cb18d840b4b747ef",
      "text": "非肿\n瘤业务保持竞争优势，为业务增长贡献重要力量。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 30,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:a93fea801431ea61e3eb4b49bcc76d3fb98170998376275c21a087af4c300f27",
      "text": "-\n新分子业务持续贡献增长，2025 年收入占比进一步提升至超30%，核酸类、偶联抗体类、\n多肽类等领域新客户快速增长。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 31,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:5b6d78eb4450d4e834074d7b288490a42fa65251deccccf14b11720b2d893262",
      "text": "预计2026年公司整体收入达到513-530亿元，持续经营业务收入同比增长18%-22%。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 32,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:85faeed87b6a012c865761f08f44485bf401176c33e76edf48ff0715d44e6bbb",
      "text": "公司将更\n加聚焦CRDMO核心战略，加速全球化能力建设和产能投放，持续提高生产经营效率。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 33,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    },
    {
      "unit_id": "urn:company-wiki:narrative-unit:sha256:9ead8ee31ed47a93bb3ef05d2cd766315052cbc8e2a043e32a2e05e56d47f854",
      "text": "上述提及的2026年全年经营业绩展望以公司目前在手订单情况为基础预测，并以全球医药行\n业发展平稳、国际贸易环境和主要运营所在地国家监管环境稳定等为前提基础，并不代表公司管\n理层对2026年度全年经营业绩的盈利预测，不构成公司对投资者的实质承诺，能否实现取决于内\n外部环境变化等多种因素影响，存在较大的不确定性。",
      "kind": "pdf_text_block",
      "paragraph": 34,
      "table": null,
      "metadata_keys": [
        "bbox",
        "block_char_end",
        "block_char_start",
        "block_sha256",
        "pdf_block",
        "geometry_feature_version",
        "geometry_granularity",
        "page_width",
        "page_height",
        "font_size",
        "font_weight",
        "native_source_view",
        "reading_layout"
      ]
    }
  ],
